  "body": "## What's Changed\n* ci: let the OpenAPI validate step handle more than one changed spec by @Fermionic-Lyu in https://github.com/InsForge/InsForge/pull/2112\n* chore(yun-tianming): drop dead modules/exports, fix OpenAPI and doc drift by @Fermionic-Lyu in https://github.com/InsForge/InsForge/pull/2111\n* fix(database): stop forwarding the client Connection header to PostgREST by @Fermionic-Lyu in https://github.com/InsForge/InsForge/pull/2119\n* fix(logs): return the newest CloudWatch logs for busy projects by @Fermionic-Lyu in https://github.com/InsForge/InsForge/pull/2123\n* fix(storage): give public objects a stable CloudFront URL per day by @Fermionic-Lyu in https://github.com/InsForge/InsForge/pull/2128\n* Bump version to 2.3.4 by @agent-zhang-beihai[bot] in https://github.com/InsForge/InsForge/pull/2129\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/InsForge/InsForge/compare/v2.3.3...v2.3.4",
